// An `asm { .. }` block needs a per-target assembler, which no milestone
// schedules yet (docs/keyword_roadmap.md D5). It used to be read as an
// inline foreign-language block; now the build stops at the seam
// `keyword.unbuilt` on every engine.
fn main() {
    print("before");
    asm {
        nop
    }
    print("after");
}
